{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Paimon": 2,
    "Player": 15,
    "Viktor": 68
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2060001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Viktor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000101": {
            "id": "206000101",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Traveler, over here. I've been watching you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000102"
            ]
          },
          "206000102": {
            "id": "206000102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What do you want?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000103"
            ]
          },
          "206000103": {
            "id": "206000103",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Come now, why the wary tone? I've got a fine proposition for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000104"
            ]
          },
          "206000104": {
            "id": "206000104",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "How would you like to join the Fatui?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000105"
            ]
          },
          "206000105": {
            "id": "206000105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You wish! Isn't that right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000107",
              "206000110"
            ]
          },
          "206000107": {
            "id": "206000107",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! What do you mean you'll give it some thought? Shouldn't we be refusing right away!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000108"
            ]
          },
          "206000108": {
            "id": "206000108",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "You've got a good eye. If you want to do great things, there's no place like the Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000111"
            ]
          },
          "206000111": {
            "id": "206000111",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Now... By the look of you, you must have questions, yes?"
          },
          "206000110": {
            "id": "206000110",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "And so what if it is? We, the Fatui, recruit from all over the continent. This is fair game, and Knights have no say in it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060002",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000201": {
            "id": "206000201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, tell me about the Fatui...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000202"
            ]
          },
          "206000202": {
            "id": "206000202",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "How very direct. Hmm, this is quite the long story.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000203"
            ]
          },
          "206000203": {
            "id": "206000203",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "But given that you're not yet an official member of the Fatui, I can't tell you, either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000204"
            ]
          },
          "206000204": {
            "id": "206000204",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "I've heard that there are a lot of hilichurls around Mondstadt, and some have even huddled together into groups.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000205"
            ]
          },
          "206000205": {
            "id": "206000205",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Let's make a deal. You take a stroll outside and bring a trophy from a Mitachurl back for me, and I'll tell you a little story. How does that sound?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000207",
              "206000210"
            ]
          },
          "206000207": {
            "id": "206000207",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Very straightforward, I like it. One hardly finds someone like you in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000208"
            ]
          },
          "206000208": {
            "id": "206000208",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Hurry along, then. I'll be waiting for you here. Did I mention that you should hurry?"
          },
          "206000210": {
            "id": "206000210",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "What, too easy? It'll do, or do you think you can take on something nastier?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000211"
            ]
          },
          "206000211": {
            "id": "206000211",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Just go, and be back soon. I'll wait here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000212"
            ]
          },
          "206000212": {
            "id": "206000212",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "*sigh* If you'd kept me waiting any longer, I'd have been put to sleep by this wind..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060003",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000301": {
            "id": "206000301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, about Delusions, then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000302"
            ]
          },
          "206000302": {
            "id": "206000302",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Hah! I say, are you an idiot, or is that just an act?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000303"
            ]
          },
          "206000303": {
            "id": "206000303",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "You're not even an official member of the Fatui. Do you really think you can ask \"what's a Delusion?\" just like that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000304"
            ]
          },
          "206000304": {
            "id": "206000304",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Do you think I'd tell you? Like those two Knights of Favonius guards at the gate?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000305"
            ]
          },
          "206000305": {
            "id": "206000305",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Still, Delusions are our precious pride and joy — it couldn't hurt to explain a little.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000306"
            ]
          },
          "206000306": {
            "id": "206000306",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "How about this, then. I believe you've seen those Treasure Hoarders outside Mondstadt?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000307"
            ]
          },
          "206000307": {
            "id": "206000307",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "They're a bunch of skulking two-bit pikers, but they do sometimes blunder into something valuable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000308"
            ]
          },
          "206000308": {
            "id": "206000308",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "If you could head over there and take a little something off them, I'll tell you a bit about Delusions in return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000310",
              "206000312"
            ]
          },
          "206000310": {
            "id": "206000310",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "I think I like you. Off you go, then."
          },
          "206000312": {
            "id": "206000312",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Money? Hahaha, do you take me for one of those Knights of Favonius?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000313"
            ]
          },
          "206000313": {
            "id": "206000313",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "No, I'd just like to see what those Treasure Hoarders can dig up in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000314"
            ]
          },
          "206000314": {
            "id": "206000314",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "That said, I don't think they'll find anything decent. *chuckles*"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060004",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000401": {
            "id": "206000401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Now, about the Tsaritsa...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000402"
            ]
          },
          "206000402": {
            "id": "206000402",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "What, you want to ask me about the Tsaritsa?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000403"
            ]
          },
          "206000403": {
            "id": "206000403",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Is she the reason you want to join the Fatui?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000404"
            ]
          },
          "206000404": {
            "id": "206000404",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "I don't mean to put you down, but weigh your words for a moment, why don't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000405"
            ]
          },
          "206000405": {
            "id": "206000405",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Still, the Tsaritsa is something that I cannot tell you about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000406"
            ]
          },
          "206000406": {
            "id": "206000406",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Why don't you go grab something off a Ruin Guard? I'm in need of something to fiddle with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000408",
              "206000410"
            ]
          },
          "206000408": {
            "id": "206000408",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Well, then off you get. I'll be waiting here."
          },
          "206000410": {
            "id": "206000410",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Eh? Can't a man collect trinkets? Or are you Mondstadt folk afraid of a little Ruin Guard?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000411"
            ]
          },
          "206000411": {
            "id": "206000411",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "To us Fatui, we would barely need to lift a finger to take care of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000412"
            ]
          },
          "206000412": {
            "id": "206000412",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Still... *sigh* this breeze really is lulling me to sleep, so I'll leave this trifling matter to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060005",
      "subQuestName": "Collect Mitachurl Loot",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000501": {
            "id": "206000501",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Don't forget, it's a Mitachurl trophy that you want. Come back here once you've got it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000502"
            ]
          },
          "206000502": {
            "id": "206000502",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "What is it, specifically? It's... a horn. Just go get it already."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060006",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Viktor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000601": {
            "id": "206000601",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Have you brought it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000602"
            ]
          },
          "206000602": {
            "id": "206000602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sure have.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000603"
            ]
          },
          "206000603": {
            "id": "206000603",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Let me have a look. Well... it's passable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000604"
            ]
          },
          "206000604": {
            "id": "206000604",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Now, let me tell you a little something about the Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000605"
            ]
          },
          "206000605": {
            "id": "206000605",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "We Fatui hail from Zapolyarny Palace. We hear the commands of Her Majesty the Tsaritsa and we inherit her will, enacting it throughout the land.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000606"
            ]
          },
          "206000606": {
            "id": "206000606",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "The eleven strongest among us have been granted the title of Harbingers by Her Majesty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000607"
            ]
          },
          "206000607": {
            "id": "206000607",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Compared to a nameless grunt like me, the Eleven Harbingers are truly great figures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000608"
            ]
          },
          "206000608": {
            "id": "206000608",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "If you join the Fatui and prove your strength, then perhaps you might be chosen by one of them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000609"
            ]
          },
          "206000609": {
            "id": "206000609",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "And then you'd be on the up and up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000610"
            ]
          },
          "206000610": {
            "id": "206000610",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "As for me? Well, I'm hardly \"chosen,\" but I am running a little errand here for Signora.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000611"
            ]
          },
          "206000611": {
            "id": "206000611",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "But if you made me choose... I'd prefer to work under Capitano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060007",
      "subQuestName": "Collect Treasure Hoarder Loot",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000701": {
            "id": "206000701",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Remember, you want to nick something off those Treasure Hoarders.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000702"
            ]
          },
          "206000702": {
            "id": "206000702",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "The deal is off if you try to fool me with any old thing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060008",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Viktor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000801": {
            "id": "206000801",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "So, have you got it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000802"
            ]
          },
          "206000802": {
            "id": "206000802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000803"
            ]
          },
          "206000803": {
            "id": "206000803",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Let me see. Gah, of course you couldn't find anything good in this backwater...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000804"
            ]
          },
          "206000804": {
            "id": "206000804",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Alright, alright, one story about Delusions coming right up. Let me think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000805"
            ]
          },
          "206000805": {
            "id": "206000805",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Delusions are treasures of incredible power, granted by Her Majesty the Tsaritsa in person. Whether faith or Vision, a Delusion makes them all look like child's play.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000806"
            ]
          },
          "206000806": {
            "id": "206000806",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Still, not everyone can wield one. Beyond the Eleven Harbingers, very few other Fatui possess a Delusion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000807"
            ]
          },
          "206000807": {
            "id": "206000807",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Even so, for an ordinary mortal like me, a Delusion is far more practical than a Vision, which one can only get by the grace of the gods.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000808"
            ]
          },
          "206000808": {
            "id": "206000808",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Ha, I see that you don't own a Vision, either. How about it, then? If you join the Fatui, who knows? Maybe you really will come to possess a Delusion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000809"
            ]
          },
          "206000809": {
            "id": "206000809",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "And that's all I have to say about Delusions. The Knights of Favonius are rather touchy about these things, so best you don't send them running my way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060009",
      "subQuestName": "Collect Ruin Guard Loot",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206000901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206000901": {
            "id": "206000901",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "You're looking for a trophy claimed from the body of a Ruin Guard, alright? Don't you get lazy and try to hoodwink me with something else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206000902"
            ]
          },
          "206000902": {
            "id": "206000902",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "*sigh* I'm getting sleepier by the minute..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2060010",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Viktor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "206001001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "206001001": {
            "id": "206001001",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "So, did you bring the goods?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001002"
            ]
          },
          "206001002": {
            "id": "206001002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sure did.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001003"
            ]
          },
          "206001003": {
            "id": "206001003",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "Oh, now this is not bad. You've got some skill, alright.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001004"
            ]
          },
          "206001004": {
            "id": "206001004",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "So, you'd like to know about Her Majesty the Tsaritsa, correct? Now, where to begin?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001005"
            ]
          },
          "206001005": {
            "id": "206001005",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "If you need a simple summary, it is that the Tsaritsa is our god.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001006"
            ]
          },
          "206001006": {
            "id": "206001006",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "This is no abstraction, only concrete truth. The Tsaritsa is the Cryo Archon, one of the Seven who hold dominion over the mortal realm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001007"
            ]
          },
          "206001007": {
            "id": "206001007",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "But to us Fatui, Her Majesty has a status beyond even that of a god.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001008"
            ]
          },
          "206001008": {
            "id": "206001008",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "As for why... I doubt you would understand even if I explained it. Or should I say, you couldn't understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001009"
            ]
          },
          "206001009": {
            "id": "206001009",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "If you wish to understand, then join us. Once you do, you will comprehend how Her Majesty the Tsaritsa is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "206001010"
            ]
          },
          "206001010": {
            "id": "206001010",
            "speakerId": 1517,
            "speakerName": "Viktor",
            "text": "...Heh, and that's all I'll say for now. That sister is giving me the stink-eye again."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}